{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 已向開發者釋出即將推出的 iOS 27.3 與 iPadOS 27.3 首個 Beta，距離 iOS 27.2 及 iPadOS 27.2 推出僅一日。已註冊開發者可前往「設定」＞「一般」＞「軟件更新」，選擇加入開發者 Beta 以下載。</p>\n<h2>iOS 27 多項功能仍待推出</h2>\n<p>Apple 先前宣佈的 iOS 27 功能仍待推出，包括重新設計的健康 App，加入 Apple Intelligence 洞察與指導，以及在 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 上提供 Reachability 功能。Apple 亦尚未重新引入讓 Safari 利用 Apple Intelligence 修正弱或已外洩密碼的功能。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 Apple Intelligence 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/apple-intelligence-main-800x500-1.webp\" width=\"800\"/></figure>\n<h2>中國擴展與 Telstra RCS</h2>\n<p>Apple 計劃隨 iOS 27.3 更新把 Apple Intelligence 擴展至中國，並可能為澳洲電訊商 Telstra 帶來 RCS 支援。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"S 162676748\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/S__162676748-471x1024.webp\" width=\"471\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T19:00:57.450672+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":397,"images":2,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T18:46:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T19:38:35.930838+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T18:58:39.995529+00:00","content_hash":"c1342c61999e311d993dba02e04fe50ba76f0863a87b8e98e936318edd180c6d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}